#. module: sale_amazon
#: model:mail.template,body_html:sale_amazon.order_sync_failure
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<div>\n"
"            <p>The synchronization of the Amazon order with reference <t t-"
"out=\"ctx.get('amazon_order_ref') or ''\">REF</t> encountered an error and "
"was not completed.</p>\n"
"            <p>Unless the order is canceled in SellerCentral, no other "
"synchronization will be attempted.</p>\n"
"            <p>To schedule a new synchronization attempt, proceed as "
"follows:\n"
"                </p><ol>\n"
"                    <li>Enter the Developer Tools.</li>\n"
"                    <li>Open the form of the Amazon Account on which the "
"order was placed.</li>\n"
"                    <li>Navigate to the Order Follow-up tab.</li>\n"
"                    <li>Set a date for <em>Last Orders Sync</em> that is "
"anterior to the last status update of the order.</li>\n"
"                    <li>Save the changes and click on the <em>SYNC ORDERS</"
"em> button.</li>\n"
"                </ol>\n"
"            \n"
"            <p>If the problem persists, contact <a href=\"https://"
"www.odoo.com/help/\">Odoo support</a>.</p>\n"
"        </div>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"<div>\n"
"            <p>Sinhronizacija Amazonovega naročila s sklicem <t t-"
"out=\"ctx.get('amazon_order_ref') or ''\">REF</t> je naletela na napako in "
"ni bila dokončana.</p>\n"
"            <p>Če naročilo ni preklicano v SellerCentral, noben drug poskus "
"sinhronizacije ne bo izveden.</p>\n"
"            <p>Za načrtovanje novega poskusa sinhronizacije postopajte "
"tako:\n"
"                </p><ol>\n"
"                    <li>Odprite razvojna orodja.</li>\n"
"                    <li>Odprite obrazec Amazonovega računa, na katerem je "
"bilo naročilo oddano.</li>\n"
"                    <li>Pojdite na zavihek Spremljanje naročila.</li>\n"
"                    <li>Nastavite datum za <em>Zadnja sinhronizacija "
"naročil</em>, ki je pred zadnjo posodobitvijo stanja naročila.</li>\n"
"                    <li>Shranite spremembe in kliknite gumb "
"<em>SINHRONIZIRAJ NAROČILA</em>.</li>\n"
"                </ol>\n"
"            \n"
"            <p>Če težava ni odpravljena, se obrnite na <a href=\"https://"
"www.odoo.com/help/\">Odoovo podporo</a>.</p>\n"
"        </div>\n"
"        "

